                0.82
              ],
              "content": "Fig. 6.16"
            }
          ],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_10_image_23.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.095,
            0.844,
            0.899,
            0.893
          ],
          "content": "So, ST || QR (Theorem 6.2) Therefore, $\\angle \\mathrm{PST} = \\angle \\mathrm{PQR}$ (Corresponding angles) (1)"
